  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fram t o m 1997 har 54 milj SEK utbetalats f&#xF6;r plantageskoleprogrammet. De 10% ytterligare som ansl&#xE5;s till avtalet f&#xF6;r st&#xF6;det till undervisning omfattar just denna komponent. Totalt kommer 89 milj att utbetalas f&#xF6;r PSEDP</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Up o 1997 54 million SEK has been disbursed. The 10% additional funs to the total Agreed amount will be covering this component: the PSEDP programme. Total amount for the PSEDP programme this final agreement period will amount to 89 million SEK</narrative>
